cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Wenn Sie dieses Werkzeug verwenden, zitieren Sie es bitte wie folgt."
title: "DigQDA — Digital QDA (AI-assisted): evidence-bound qualitative data analysis with local models"
abstract: >-
  An open, versioned method-contract toolkit for evidence-bound qualitative
  data analysis (QDA) with local language models. The model proposes;
  deterministic code verifies. Single-purpose, human-in-the-loop analytic
  operations with an explicit method claim, strict output schema, external
  quote/locator validation, and fail-closed semantics.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Behnamshad
    given-names: Klaus
version: "0.4.0"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - qualitative data analysis
  - QDA
  - computer-assisted qualitative analysis
  - local large language models
  - evidence-bound coding
  - human-in-the-loop
  - oral history
